  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Forty-One Exchange (Set collection / Draw-Discard). Deal: 4 cards per player; stock and discard piles setup. Turn: Draw 1 card (stock or discard), then discard 1 card (maintaining 4-card hand). Card values: Ace=11, K/Q/J=10, 2-10=face value. Win condition: First to get 4 cards of same suit totaling exactly 41 points wins immediately. If stock exhausted: highest single-suit total wins. Strategy: Lock into one suit early; track opponent discard patterns; hold Aces and 10-value cards.',
    Player: 'Welcome to Forty-One Exchange, the fast Indonesian card game. Build a hand of four cards from the same suit that totals 41 points. On your turn, draw from the stock or discard pile, then discard one card. First to reach 41 wins immediately. If the deck runs out, highest suit total wins.',
    objective: 'Collect 4 cards of the same suit that sum to 41, or have the highest total suit-score when the deck runs out.',
    gameplay: '1. Turns: Players take turns clockwise.\n2. Draw: A player draws one card from either the stock or the discard pile.\n3. Discard: After drawing, the player MUST discard one card, maintaining a total of 4 in their hand.\n4. Ending: The game ends immediately if a player reaches 41 points. Otherwise, it ends when the stock is empty.',
    keyRules: [
      'The 41 Rule: A perfect hand consists of an Ace (11) and three 10-value cards (K, Q, J, 10).',
      'Discard Awareness: You cannot draw a card and then immediately discard that same card.',
      'Winning condition: Collect 4 cards of the same suit that sum to 41, or have the highest total suit-score when the deck runs out.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: false,
    trumpBonusValues: null,
