    turnFlow: '1. Turns: Players take turns clockwise.\n2. Draw: A player draws one card from either the stock or the discard pile.\n3. Discard: After drawing, the player MUST discard one card, maintaining a total of 4 in their hand.\n4. Ending: The game ends immediately if a player reaches 41 points. Otherwise, it ends when the stock is empty.',
